[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1152.87, "timestamp": "00:19:12", "text": "好了，我回来了。 我回来了。 我回来了。 非常非常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1155.909, "timestamp": "00:19:15", "text": "抱歉。  [笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1157.909, "timestamp": "00:19:17", "text": "我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1161.029, "timestamp": "00:19:21", "text": "好吧，我没想到会这样。  [笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1163.19, "timestamp": "00:19:23", "text": "我的天哪，我真没想到。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1165.51, "timestamp": "00:19:25", "text": "本来想做点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1167.868, "timestamp": "00:19:27", "text": "别的事，结果没想到"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1168.709, "timestamp": "00:19:28", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "welcome back"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1171.798, "timestamp": "00:19:31", "text": "（嗤笑）送货员打电话来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1173.19, "timestamp": "00:19:33", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1175.99, "timestamp": "00:19:35", "text": "我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1179.83, "timestamp": "00:19:39", "text": "感谢您的耐心等待。 我很抱歉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1182.39, "timestamp": "00:19:42", "text": "我甚至连文本来源都没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1185.51, "timestamp": "00:19:45", "text": "我当时有吗？ 好的。 呃，这是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1189.19, "timestamp": "00:19:49", "text": "？ 哦，是的。 我马上回来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1191.75, "timestamp": "00:19:51", "text": "嗯，是的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1193.806, "timestamp": "00:19:53", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hf90Xv-jHeOR8gSxxrToBAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hf90Xv-jHeOR8gSxxrToBA"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1193.99, "timestamp": "00:19:53", "text": "，我刚才说了句“马上回来”。 哦，是的。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1197.029, "timestamp": "00:19:57", "text": "。 我已经很久没用过这套 OBS 设置了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1199.43, "timestamp": "00:19:59", "text": "。"}]